scenarios={
 'First visit, just curious': {'title':'Start with possibility, not a questionnaire.','path':['Purpose + optional Play introduction','Explore the steps','Preview a local visual practice','Start, browse elsewhere or leave'],'state':'Intro: never → started/completed/skipped independently. AI: not required. Memory: off.','keep':'No disclosure, account, belief test or memory setup is needed.'},
 'First visit, something on my mind': {'title':'My words stay mine until I choose to send.','path':['Type or dictate with microphone disclosure','Review the editable words','Send this context to AI, or use a local practice','Why this? → Start / adjust / browse'],'state':'Input: typing/recording → processing → review. Generation: pending → validated ready, or recovery.','keep':'Dictation audio is processed before text submission; that distinction is explained before capture.'},
 'Returning with unfinished work': {'title':'Continue what you made.','path':['Neutral Welcome back','Resume / Start fresh / Explore','Restore the same scene version and authored answers','Pause or finish at your own pace'],'state':'Exercise: paused → active. Intro: no forced replay. Memory: independent of saved practice.','keep':'Starting fresh asks before replacing work. The landing screen reveals no private reflection text.'},
 'Returning after an absence': {'title':'No catching up required.','path':['Neutral welcome','Resume or explore by choice','Open My memory only if useful','Keep, edit, pause use or forget outdated context'],'state':'No absence score or inferred emotional state. Outdated memory is a user correction.','keep':'“Still relevant?” belongs inside memory review, not a revealing personal quotation on the cover.'},
 'AI declined or offline': {'title':'A useful practice is still available.','path':['Retain the draft and current practice','Explain the unavailable operation briefly','Continue with a labeled local scene / retry / leave','Never pass a fallback off as personalized AI'],'state':'AI consent: declined, or generation: failed. Exercise state is preserved.','keep':'No silent retry or transmission. A local example does not pretend to know the person.'},
 'Recording canceled or permission denied': {'title':'The microphone state is unambiguous.','path':['Wait for permission without animation','Listening waveform only once capture starts','Stop → microphone off → processing → final text','Discard / failure → no upload; text still usable'],'state':'Canceled sessions invalidate late streams and responses. Physical microphone testing remains unverified.','keep':'This flow is implemented and tested with synthetic audio. Navigation and page hiding release capture.'},
 'Remembering, pausing or deleting': {'title':'Remember what I choose, for the purpose I choose.','path':['Write or preview a short memory','Remember / Edit / Not now','Separately allow use with an AI request','Pause use or delete; confirm actual success'],'state':'Memory: off/on/paused/deleting/unavailable. Revision checks reject stale edits after deletion.','keep':'No automatic import from practice answers. No inferred personality profile. Plaintext storage, not claimed encryption.'},
 'Too intense or simply wrong': {'title':'Correction is an ordinary part of the experience.','path':['Pause immediately','Stop optional motion/audio; show save status','Edit the premise / simple view / local alternative','Resume exact work, or deliberately discard'],'state':'Feedback changes the selected exercise, not a hidden score about the person.','keep':'No pressure to reconcile, contact someone, breathe in a prescribed way or finish a step.'}}
sections=''.join(f'<section id="{name}"><div class="section-heading"><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h2>{title}</h2><p>{desc}</p></div></div><div class="diagram">{svg}</div><p class="download"><a href="{name}.svg">Open full-size SVG</a></p></section>' for i,(name,title,desc,svg) in enumerate(zip(['arrival','practice','consent'],['Many ways to arrive','A practice with open exits','Memory is a separate choice'],['Curiosity, reflection and returning work meet in the same stable shell.','The scene changes. Back, Pause, personal agency and a clear ending do not.','Processing now, saving work and remembering for later have distinct boundaries.'],svgs)))
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>soulfire · journey design</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#28483c;--sage:#617d68;--paper:#f7f4ea;--gold:#aa844b}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:18px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}header{padding:64px max(24px,calc((100vw - 1120px)/2));background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 15%,#d8bd82a0,transparent 35%),linear-gradient(135deg,#173d36,#4e705d);color:#fff9e9}header .label{letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px;color:#e7cf9c}h1{font:clamp(40px,6vw,76px)/1.05 Georgia,serif;margin:24px 0}header p{max-width:760px;font-size:21px;color:#eceddf}header a{display:inline-block;margin:8px 20px 0 0;font-size:16px}nav{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:20px 24px;justify-content:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d1d9ca}main{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:24px}section{margin:36px 0 80px;scroll-margin-top:20px}h2{font:36px/1.15 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 12px}.section-heading{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-bottom:26px}.section-heading>span{font:42px Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold)}.section-heading p{margin:0}.legend{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}.legend span{padding:8px 18px;border-radius:30px;border:1px solid #8c9f8e;background:#fffdf7}.legend .exists{background:#e2ece2;border-color:#4c6d59}.legend .proposed{background:#fff8e9;border:1px dashed #967746}.diagram{border:1px solid #d1d9ca;border-radius:24px;overflow:auto}.diagram svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:740px}.download{text-align:right;font-size:15px}.lab{padding:30px;background:#e8eddf;border-radius:24px}.lab label{display:block;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px}.lab select{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #91a38b;color:var(--ink);background:#fffdf7}.lab h3{font:30px Georgia,serif;margin-bottom:18px}.lab ol{padding-left:26px}.lab li{padding:8px 0}.note{padding:20px;border-left:3px solid var(--gold);background:#fffaf0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px}.grid article{padding:28px;background:#fffdf7;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #dae0d1}.grid h3{margin-top:0}ul{padding-left:22px}footer{padding:32px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid #d1d9ca;font-size:15px}button,a,select{outline-offset:5px}details{margin:24px 0;padding:20px;border:1px solid #d1d9ca;border-radius:15px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:17px}header{padding:40px 24px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h2{font-size:30px}.lab{padding:22px}.diagram{margin:0 -10px}.section-heading{gap:14px}.legend{gap:8px;font-size:14px}}@media print{nav,.lab select{display:none}.diagram svg{min-width:0}section{break-inside:avoid}header{color:#28483c;background:none}header p{color:inherit}}
</style><header><div class="label">soulfire · design review · October 24, 2026</div><h1>A place to arrive.<br>A way to find your own next step.</h1><p>Spiritual guidance through reflection and principles. An immersive landscape with familiar choices, clear consent and room to leave.</p><a href="http://127.0.0.1:3100">Open the working prototype ↗</a><a href="journeys.md">Read the complete state contract</a></header><nav aria-label="Review sections"><a href="#arrival">Arrival</a><a href="#practice">Practice</a><a href="#consent">Consent & memory</a><a href="#scenarios">Explore states</a><a href="#status">Implementation status</a></nav><main><p class="note"><strong>Journey proposal plus a working architecture slice.</strong> The local prototype now includes one reusable visual influence map and opt-in SQLite memory. All-twelve-step expansion and broader journey refinements remain proposals.</p><div class="legend" aria-label="Diagram legend"><span class="exists">Exists in prototype</span><span>Mixed: exists + proposed refinements</span><span class="proposed">Proposed</span></div>'''+sections+'''<section id="scenarios"><div class="section-heading"><span>04</span><div><h2>What happens when…</h2><p>Change the scenario to inspect the proposed journey and its data boundaries.</p></div></div><div class="lab"><label for="scenario">Visit or interruption</label><select id="scenario">'''+''.join(f'<option>{escape(k)}</option>' for k in scenarios)+'''</select><div id="scenario-result" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section><section id="status"><h2>What is real, and what comes next</h2><div class="grid"><article><h3>Working now</h3><ul><li>Optional Kokoro intro and Play/Replay history.</li><li>Steps 1, 3, 10 and 11 with editable trusted blocks.</li><li>Private reflection, selected sharing, optional quiet and chosen action.</li><li>Opt-in saved practice in this browser.</li><li>Listening waveform, explicit Stop and Discard.</li><li>Music, motion controls and reduced-motion support.</li><li>Visual influence map with keyboard/simple controls.</li><li>Opt-in local memory: edit, pause AI use, delete.</li><li>Per-request memory consent and stale-write protection.</li></ul></article><article><h3>Proposed / deliberately deferred</h3><ul><li>Twelve step-specific interactive scene recipes.</li><li>Stable shell with Why this, adjust and simple view.</li><li>Shared pilot identity and per-user storage isolation.</li><li>Human usefulness studies and all-step scene validation.</li></ul></article></div><details><summary>Research and evidence boundaries</summary><p>HAX and PAIR inform correction, control and recovery. CHI design principles inform adaptive interfaces. WCAG informs accessible alternatives. Laboratory work on labeling or sound does not validate soulfire as treatment.</p><p><a href="journeys.md">Sources, detailed invariants and deferred scope</a></p></details><details><summary>BB harness comparison status</summary><p>Catalog verified: Codex / GPT-6-Astra; Claude Code / Fable 5.1; Claude Code / Opus 5 (1M). No independent runs yet: the shared BB server injects unrelated global notes, and a per-thread context-isolation override was not found. No private material was submitted or shared settings changed.</p><p><a href="harness-comparison.md">Exact discovery and blocker</a> · <a href="brief.md">Minimal review brief</a></p></details></section></main><footer>Design hypotheses to test for comprehension, agency and relevance. No forced step order, diagnosis, efficacy claim or guilt streak.</footer><script>const scenarios='''+json.dumps(scenarios)+''';const select=document.getElementById('scenario');function render(){const d=scenarios[select.value],target=document.getElementById('scenario-result');target.replaceChildren();const h=document.createElement('h3');h.textContent=d.title;target.append(h);const ol=document.createElement('ol');d.path.forEach(t=>{const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=t;ol.append(li)});target.append(ol);for(const t of [d.state,d.keep]){const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=t;target.append(p)}}select.addEventListener('change',render);render();</script></html>'''
(out/'index.html').write_text(html)
